<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>go-authn – X509</title><link>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.4/ko/tags/x509/</link><description>Recent content in X509 on go-authn</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>ko</language><atom:link href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.4/ko/tags/x509/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>인증서</title><link>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.4/ko/authn-bridge/certificates/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.4/ko/authn-bridge/certificates/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;로그인한 사람은 몇 시간 동안 SSH 공개 키를 인증받거나 X.509 클라이언트 인증서를
발급받을 수 있습니다. 공급자의 CA를 신뢰하는 서버는 그곳에서 편집할 계정 파일 없이
그들을 들여보냅니다. 모든 인증서는 &lt;strong&gt;전달되기 전에 &lt;code&gt;certificates_file&lt;/code&gt;에 기록됩니다.&lt;/strong&gt;
기록할 수 없는 인증서는 폐기할 수 없으므로 발급되지 않으며, 폐기된 인증서는&lt;a href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.4/ko/authn-bridge/revocation/"&gt;KRL과 CRL&lt;/a&gt;에 게시됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="ssh-certificates"&gt;SSH 인증서&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="ssh-certificates"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#ssh-certificates" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-hcl" data-lang="hcl"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;certificates_file&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;/var/lib/authn-bridge/certificates.json&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;ssh_ca&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; key_file&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;/var/lib/authn-bridge/ssh-ca&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # authn-bridge keygen --ssh-ca; Ed25519
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; validity&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;12h&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # the default; a week at most
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;client&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;sftp&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; device&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kt"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; ssh_certificates&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kt"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;authn-bridge ssh-cert --issuer https://login.example.org --client sftp&lt;/code&gt;는 코드로
로그인하고, &lt;code&gt;ssh&lt;/code&gt; 스코프의 토큰과 함께 &lt;code&gt;~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub&lt;/code&gt;(또는 &lt;code&gt;--key&lt;/code&gt;)를&lt;code&gt;/ssh/certificate&lt;/code&gt;에 보내며, &lt;code&gt;ssh&lt;/code&gt;와 &lt;code&gt;sftp&lt;/code&gt;가 찾을 수 있는 그 옆에&lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;key&amp;gt;-cert.pub&lt;/code&gt;을 기록합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CA 키는 Ed25519여야 합니다. RSA CA 키는 별도 지시가 없으면 SHA-1로 서명하는데,OpenSSH는 8.8부터 기본적으로 이를 거부합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;인증서가 말하는 것.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;정확히 하나의 principal&lt;/strong&gt;: 클라이언트의 프로필이 다른 클레임을 지정하지 않는 한
그 사람의 &lt;code&gt;preferred_username&lt;/code&gt;입니다. principal이 없는 인증서는 &lt;em&gt;모든&lt;/em&gt; 사용자에게
유효하므로(PROTOCOL.certkeys), 사용자 이름이 없는 사람은 인증서를 받지 못합니다.쉼표, 공백, 따옴표, 백슬래시 또는 제어 문자를 포함한 이름은 거부됩니다(&lt;code&gt;403&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;code&gt;sshd&lt;/code&gt;가 &lt;code&gt;principals=&amp;quot;a,b&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt;와 &lt;code&gt;AuthorizedPrincipalsFile&lt;/code&gt; 항목을 목록으로 읽으므로
그런 이름 하나가 둘이 되기 때문입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key ID&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;principal&amp;gt; sub=&amp;lt;sub&amp;gt; jti=&amp;lt;token id&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;: &lt;code&gt;sshd&lt;/code&gt;가 기록하는 것입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;기본적으로 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;permit-*&lt;/code&gt; 확장 없음&lt;/strong&gt;. SFTP에는 필요하지 않으며, pty도 포워딩도 rc
파일도 허용하지 않는 인증서는 파일 접근만 허용합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;토큰이 그룹을 담고 있으면 &lt;code&gt;groups@go-authn.org&lt;/code&gt; 확장에 &lt;strong&gt;그 사람의 그룹&lt;/strong&gt;이 한
줄에 하나씩 들어갑니다. OpenSSH는 이를 무시합니다. 이는 서명되어 있으므로 그룹으로
권한을 부여하는 서버는 이를 믿을 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;유효 기간&lt;/strong&gt;은 5분 전부터(시계가 맞지 않는 경우를 위해) 지금부터 &lt;code&gt;validity&lt;/code&gt;까지,또는 IdP의 세션이 그보다 먼저 끝나면 그때까지입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;키&lt;/strong&gt;는 Ed25519, ECDSA P-256/384/521, 보안 키(&lt;code&gt;sk-&lt;/code&gt;), 또는 2048비트 이상의 RSA여야
합니다. 인증서를 키로 제시하면 거부됩니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="the-eurohpc-ssh-ca-profile"&gt;EuroHPC SSH CA 프로필&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="the-eurohpc-ssh-ca-profile"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#the-eurohpc-ssh-ca-profile" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;EuroHPC Federation Platform의 SSH CA(GÉANT / MyAccessID)는 한 시간 동안 유효한
Ed25519 인증서를 발급하며, 페더레이션 전체에서 그 사람을 지명하는 principal 하나와,GÉANT의 &lt;code&gt;ssh-domain-grant@core.aai.geant.org&lt;/code&gt; 확장에 인증서가 대상으로 하는 호스트를
담습니다. 클라이언트는 그 형태로 인증서를 발급받을 수 있습니다. 모든 키는 클라이언트별
선택 사항이며, 아무것도 설정하지 않은 클라이언트는 위의 인증서를 받습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-hcl" data-lang="hcl"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;client&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;efp&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; device&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kt"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; ssh_certificates&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kt"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; ssh_principal_claim&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;voperson_id&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # the default is preferred_username
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; ssh_validity&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;1h&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # never longer than ssh_ca&amp;#39;s, nor the IdP&amp;#39;s session
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; ssh_extensions&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;permit-pty&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # none by default
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; ssh_domain_grants&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;login.hpc.example.org&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # the hosting entity&amp;#39;s hosts
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # ssh_source_address = [&amp;#34;192.0.2.0/24&amp;#34;] # the source-address critical option
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;키&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;ssh_principal_claim&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;preferred_username&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;sub&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;voperson_id&lt;/code&gt; 또는 &lt;code&gt;eduperson_principal_name&lt;/code&gt;. 마지막 둘은 &lt;code&gt;eduperson&lt;/code&gt; 스코프가 내주며 토큰이 이를 가지고 있어야 합니다(&lt;code&gt;authn-bridge ssh-cert --scope eduperson&lt;/code&gt;). 그렇지 않거나 IdP가 그런 속성을 내주지 않으면 어느 쪽인지 알려 주는 &lt;code&gt;403&lt;/code&gt;이 응답됩니다&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;ssh_extensions&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;permit-pty&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;permit-user-rc&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;permit-port-forwarding&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;permit-agent-forwarding&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;permit-X11-forwarding&lt;/code&gt; 중에서&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;ssh_source_address&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;주소 또는 CIDR 접두사, &lt;code&gt;source-address&lt;/code&gt;에 표준 형식으로 기록됨&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;ssh_validity&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;이 클라이언트에 대해 &lt;code&gt;ssh_ca&lt;/code&gt;의 &lt;code&gt;validity&lt;/code&gt;보다 길지 않음(같은 값은 허용)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;ssh_domain_grants&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;도메인 패턴으로, &lt;a href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.4/ko/sshcert/"&gt;go-authn/sshcert&lt;/a&gt;의 &lt;code&gt;ValidatePattern&lt;/code&gt;으로 검사하고 &lt;code&gt;EncodeDomainGrant&lt;/code&gt;로 인코딩함&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="what-the-profile-refuses"&gt;프로필이 거부하는 것&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="what-the-profile-refuses"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#what-the-profile-refuses" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;각각 시작할 때 &lt;code&gt;authn-bridge check&lt;/code&gt;가 출력합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;authn-bridge: client &amp;#34;efp&amp;#34;: ssh_validity = 24h0m0s: longer than the ssh_ca validity, 12h0m0s
authn-bridge: client &amp;#34;efp&amp;#34;: ssh_extensions: &amp;#34;no-touch-required&amp;#34; is not one of permit-X11-forwarding, permit-agent-forwarding, permit-port-forwarding, permit-pty, permit-user-rc
authn-bridge: client &amp;#34;src&amp;#34;: ssh_source_address: &amp;#34;192.0.2.1/24&amp;#34; has bits set under its mask: 192.0.2.0/24?
authn-bridge: client &amp;#34;x&amp;#34;: ssh_principal_claim, ssh_extensions, ssh_source_address, ssh_validity and ssh_domain_grants shape SSH certificates: they need ssh_certificates = true&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;no-touch-required&lt;/code&gt;는 제공되지 않습니다. 이는 그 사람 &lt;strong&gt;자신의&lt;/strong&gt; 보안 키에 대한
사용자 존재 확인을 면제하는 것이며, 클라이언트의 모든 사람을 위해 공급자가 내줄 수
있는 것이 아닙니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;도메인 권한 부여는 먼저 사양의 문법에, 그다음 이 공급자 자신의 정책에 맞아야
합니다. 소문자, 레이블 두 개 이상, 그리고 등록 가능한 도메인 아래에서만 와일드카드.마지막 와일드카드 오른쪽에 고정된 부분은 공개 접미사(Public Suffix List)여서는 안
됩니다. &lt;code&gt;*.ac.uk&lt;/code&gt;는 그 아래의 모든 기관에 권한을 부여하게 됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;authn-bridge: client &amp;#34;efp&amp;#34;: ssh_domain_grants: &amp;#34;*.ac.uk&amp;#34;: a wildcard over the public suffix &amp;#34;ac.uk&amp;#34; grants every domain under it
authn-bridge: client &amp;#34;efp&amp;#34;: ssh_domain_grants: &amp;#34;Login.hpc.example.org&amp;#34;: written in lower case, as hosting entities&amp;#39; domains are compared
authn-bridge: client &amp;#34;efp&amp;#34;: ssh_domain_grants: &amp;#34;login.hpc.*&amp;#34;: sshcert: invalid domain pattern: pattern &amp;#34;login.hpc.*&amp;#34; has a wildcard in its rightmost label&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
