data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="trusting-it-from-a-site"&gt;사이트에서 신뢰하기&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="trusting-it-from-a-site"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#trusting-it-from-a-site" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;GET /ssh/config&lt;/code&gt;는 EFP가 자신의 것을 게시하는 형태로 CA 키를 게시하므로, 사이트는
이 공급자의 URL로 EFP의 신뢰 지침을 따르면 됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;$ curl -s http://127.0.0.1:28473/ssh/config
{&amp;#34;PublicKey&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIBNOYvUrAPdRTB&amp;#43;38aml&amp;#43;twPN&amp;#43;2k1shD3l62v8NxrIje&amp;#34;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;curl -s https://login.example.org/ssh/config &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; jq -r &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;.PublicKey&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &amp;gt; /etc/ssh/bridge-ssh-ca.pub
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;echo&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;TrustedUserCAKeys /etc/ssh/bridge-ssh-ca.pub&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &amp;gt;&amp;gt; /etc/ssh/sshd_config&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;sshd는 도메인 권한 부여를 무시합니다. 사이트는 &lt;code&gt;AuthorizedPrincipalsCommand&lt;/code&gt;로
이를 기준으로 걸러 냅니다.&lt;a href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.4/ko/sshcert/authorize/"&gt;sshcert-authorize&lt;/a&gt;는 권한 부여가 호스트를
지정하지 않는 인증서와 권한 부여가 아예 없는 인증서를 거부합니다. CA는 OpenID
디스커버리 문서에 없습니다. 어떤 OpenID Connect 메타데이터도 SSH CA를 지정하지
않습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EFP 자체 CA와 여전히 다른 점: 위에서처럼 &lt;code&gt;ssh_principal_claim = &amp;quot;voperson_id&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt;이면
principal은 사람의 기관이 내준 &lt;code&gt;subject-id&lt;/code&gt;를 소문자로 한 것이며 MyAccessID
식별자가 아닙니다. 토큰이 그룹을 담고 있으면 그룹 확장이 있습니다. 그리고 &lt;strong&gt;KRL이
있습니다.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;GET /ssh/krl&lt;/code&gt;이 여기서 비활성화된 사람들의 인증서를 나열합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="x509-client-certificates-for-nfs-over-tls"&gt;NFS over TLS용 X.509 클라이언트 인증서&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="x509-client-certificates-for-nfs-over-tls"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#x509-client-certificates-for-nfs-over-tls" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;NFS over TLS(RFC 9289)는 클라이언트를 인증서로 지명할 수 있습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-hcl" data-lang="hcl"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;certificates_file&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;/var/lib/authn-bridge/certificates.json&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;x509_ca&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; key_file&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;/var/lib/authn-bridge/nfs-ca/ca.key&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # authn-bridge keygen --x509-ca /var/lib/authn-bridge/nfs-ca
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; cert_file&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;/var/lib/authn-bridge/nfs-ca/ca.crt&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # what go-fileshare trusts
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; validity&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;12h&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # the default; a week at most
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;client&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;nfs&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; device&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kt"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; x509_certificates&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kt"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;authn-bridge nfs-cert --issuer ... --client nfs&lt;/code&gt;는 그 사람의 머신에서 P-256 키를
만들고, &lt;code&gt;nfs&lt;/code&gt; 스코프의 토큰과 함께 인증서 요청을 &lt;code&gt;/x509/cert&lt;/code&gt;에 보내며, 인증서와
키를 기록합니다. CA 키는 P-256이어야 하고, 그 인증서는 인증서와 CRL에 서명하는
CA여야 합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;인증서가 말하는 것.&lt;/strong&gt; 요청의 subject와 확장은 무시됩니다. 인증되는 것은 그 사람이
요청한 것이 아니라 토큰의 사람입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;사람, &lt;code&gt;user@domain&lt;/code&gt;은 UTF8String을 담은 &lt;strong&gt;하나의&lt;/strong&gt; subjectAltName &lt;code&gt;otherName&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;code&gt;1.3.6.1.4.1.2238.1.1.1&lt;/code&gt;로 들어가며, FreeBSD의 &lt;code&gt;rpc.tlsservd -u&lt;/code&gt;가 이를 읽는
곳입니다. &lt;code&gt;@&lt;/code&gt;가 없거나 3바이트 미만인 사용자 이름은 거부됩니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;각 그룹은 그 옆에 URI 이름으로:&lt;code&gt;tag:go-authn.github.io,2026:group:&amp;lt;the group, percent-encoded&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CN은 사용자 이름이며, 64자를 넘으면 subject는 비고 subjectAltName은 critical이
됩니다(RFC 5280).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;클라이언트 인증 전용이며 CRL 배포 지점은 &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;issuer&amp;gt;/x509/crl&lt;/code&gt;입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5분 전부터 &lt;code&gt;validity&lt;/code&gt;, IdP의 세션, CA 자체의 인증서 중 먼저 끝나는 때까지
유효합니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;P-256 또는 RSA(2048비트 이상) 키와 그 키로 서명한 요청.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:overflow-x-auto hx:mt-6 hx:flex hx:rounded-lg hx:border hx:py-2 hx:ltr:pr-4 hx:rtl:pl-4 hx:contrast-more:border-current hx:contrast-more:dark:border-current hx:border-amber-200 hx:bg-amber-100 hx:text-amber-900 hx:dark:border-amber-200/30 hx:dark:bg-amber-900/30 hx:dark:text-amber-200"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:ltr:pl-3 hx:ltr:pr-2 hx:rtl:pr-3 hx:rtl:pl-2"&gt;&lt;svg height=1.2em class="hx:inline-block hx:align-middle" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:w-full hx:min-w-0 hx:leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:mt-6 hx:leading-7 hx:first:mt-0"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;인증서는 머신을 지명하며, 그것을 쓰는 사용자를 지명하지 않습니다&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RFC 9289: 서버는 &amp;ldquo;cannot utilize the remote TLS peer identity to authenticate RPC
users&amp;rdquo;. Linux는 마운트별로 클라이언트 인증서를 설정하므로, 그 마운트를 쓰는 모두가
인증서가 지명하는 그 사람입니다. 이는 한 사람이 쓰는 머신을 위한 것이며&lt;code&gt;authn-bridge nfs-cert&lt;/code&gt;가 그렇게 알려 줍니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="a-certificate-request-held-open-across-a-disabling"&gt;비활성화 중에도 열려 있는 인증서 요청&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="a-certificate-request-held-open-across-a-disabling"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#a-certificate-request-held-open-across-a-disabling" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;토큰은 요청이 시작될 때 검사되고, 본문은 클라이언트가 보내는 속도로 그 뒤에
읽힙니다. 그래서 인증서를 먼저 기록한 다음 토큰과 사람을 다시 검사합니다. 그 사이에
사람이 비활성화되었거나 토큰이 폐기되었다면, 방금 기록한 인증서는 폐기되고 응답은&lt;code&gt;401&lt;/code&gt;입니다. 폐기가 인증서를 보았거나, 인증서가 폐기를 보게 됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>